# Byte-exact trees (last, so they win over the type rules above): research receipts and worker evidence record SHA-256 of these files, and third-party licence texts
# stay as shipped. -text means git never converts them (they keep their committed bytes on every OS).
asset-library/** -text
workers/traffic/reference-network/** -text
Assets/ChooGuard/ThirdParty/** -text
Assets/ChooGuard/Art/StationInterior/Kits/** -text
